            "id": "761590401",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Nicole",
            "text": "Anyway... My \"guidance\" doesn't end until you open that chest! For the sake of the dictionary, can you please see what's inside?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
